<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="en"> <head> <meta charset="utf-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"> <title>focalytics archive report</title> <style>[embedded-css]</style> </head> <body> <main class="shell"> <section class="hero"> <div class="eyebrow">focalytics offline report</div> <h1 class="title">gallery</h1> <p class="subtitle">A self-contained archive dashboard built from local aggregate analysis. No external scripts, no network requests, and no per-photo frontend payloads.</p> <div class="meta">Generated 2026-04-05 11:05 UTC</div> <div class="cards"> <article class="card"> <div class="card-label">Total photos analyzed</div> <div class="card-value">3</div> </article> <article class="card"> <div class="card-label">Archive span</div> <div class="card-value">Photos taken between 2020-01-02 and 2021-05-03.</div> </article> <article class="card"> <div class="card-label">Top camera</div> <div class="card-value">Camera A</div> </article> <article class="card"> <div class="card-label">Top lens</div> <div class="card-value">Lens Prime</div> </article> <article class="card"> <div class="card-label">Top focal length</div> <div class="card-value">50mm</div> </article> <article class="card"> <div class="card-label">Warning summary</div> <div class="card-value">2 metadata warnings were recorded during analysis.</div> </article> </div> </section> <section class="section-grid"> <article class="panel"> <h2>Timeline</h2> <p class="section-copy">Year-level volume and daily activity derived from normalized capture dates.</p> <div class="bar-list"> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>2020</span><span class="bar-value">2</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 100.00%"></div></div> </div> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>2021</span><span class="bar-value">1</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 50.00%"></div></div> </div> </div> <div class="heatmap-wrap"> <svg class="heatmap">[heatmap]</svg> </div> <div class="chart-caption">Each tile represents one day in the archive span, grouped by week.</div> <details class="note"> <summary>Note: 3 missing-data exclusions affected this section.</summary> <ul> <li>capture time unavailable after embedded, sidecar, and fallback recovery (3)</li> </ul> </details> </article> <div class="metrics-grid"> <article class="panel"> <h3>Camera bodies</h3> <p class="section-copy">Most-used cameras in the archive</p> <div class="bar-list"> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>Camera A</span><span class="bar-value">2</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 100.00%"></div></div> </div> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>Camera B</span><span class="bar-value">1</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 50.00%"></div></div> </div> </div> <details class="note"> <summary>Note: 1 missing-data exclusion affected this section.</summary> <ul> <li>camera model unavailable (1)</li> </ul> </details> </article> <article class="panel"> <h3>Lenses</h3> <p class="section-copy">Most-used lenses in the archive</p> <div class="bar-list"> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>Lens Prime</span><span class="bar-value">2</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 100.00%"></div></div> </div> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>Lens Zoom</span><span class="bar-value">1</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 50.00%"></div></div> </div> </div> </article> <article class="panel"> <h3>Focal length</h3> <p class="section-copy">Normalized focal length usage</p> <div class="bar-list"> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>50mm</span><span class="bar-value">2</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 100.00%"></div></div> </div> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>85mm</span><span class="bar-value">1</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 50.00%"></div></div> </div> </div> </article> <article class="panel"> <h3>Aperture</h3> <p class="section-copy">How often apertures were used</p> <div class="bar-list"> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>f/2.8</span><span class="bar-value">2</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 100.00%"></div></div> </div> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>f/4</span><span class="bar-value">1</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 50.00%"></div></div> </div> </div> </article> <article class="panel"> <h3>Shutter speed</h3> <p class="section-copy">Exposure duration distribution</p> <div class="bar-list"> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>1/125s</span><span class="bar-value">2</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 100.00%"></div></div> </div> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>1/60s</span><span class="bar-value">1</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 50.00%"></div></div> </div> </div> </article> <article class="panel"> <h3>ISO</h3> <p class="section-copy">Sensitivity distribution</p> <div class="bar-list"> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>ISO 100</span><span class="bar-value">1</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 50.00%"></div></div> </div> <div class="bar-row"> <div class="bar-header"><span>ISO 200</span><span class="bar-value">2</span></div> <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 100.00%"></div></div> </div> </div> </article> </div> </section> <div class="footer">Generated locally by focalytics.</div> </main> </body> </html>